<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <ResourcePreloader />
    @* docs/theming.md's "re-declare these tokens and change nothing else" contract: blazeforms.css
       and blazeforms-designer.css load BEFORE app.css so that, at equal specificity, this host's
       own --bf-* re-declarations win the cascade. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/BlazeForms.Renderer/blazeforms.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/BlazeForms.Designer/blazeforms-designer.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["app.css"]" />
    @* MudBlazor lives only in this sample (never src/) -- see Mud/MudFieldComponentRegistry.cs.
       Its stylesheet and Roboto webfont are the two assets its own setup docs require in <head>. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,400,500,700&display=swap" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["BlazeForms.Sample.styles.css"]" />
    <ImportMap />
    <HeadOutlet @rendermode="InteractiveServer" />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    <ReconnectModal />
    <script src="@Assets["_framework/blazor.web.js"]"></script>
    <script src="_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
